# Local Development Commands

This project uses **`uv`** as the Python package/runtime manager. Never use bare `python` or `python3` to run Django commands.

## Running Django Commands

```bash
# ✅ CORRECT
uv run python manage.py check
uv run python manage.py migrate
uv run python manage.py shell

# ❌ WRONG
python manage.py check
python3 manage.py check
.venv/bin/python manage.py check
```

## Running Tests

```bash
# Run all tests
uv run pytest

# Run a specific test file
uv run pytest app/tests/test_base_job_get_job.py -v

# Run a specific test case
uv run pytest app/tests/test_base_job_get_job.py::BaseJobGetJobTests::test_name -v
```

## Installing Dependencies

```bash
# Sync all deps including dev (pytest etc.)
uv sync --dev

# Add a new dependency
uv add package-name
```
